<title>POLAND: KPBP Bick changes dividend record date.</title>
<headline>KPBP Bick changes dividend record date.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	  1995</p>
<p> Amount (PLN)			  0.2	   0.0</p>
<p> Pay				     Nov 5</p>
<p> Record				  Aug 18</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the Polish builder is Przedsiebiorstwo Budownictwa Przemyslowego KPBP Bick SA. The firm had previously set the record date at December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
